 "notes": "Sparse map: the eastern half of the Offlumer See at Neuenkirchen with the bathing beach, the reed belts and the jetty from OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors), and the divers' entry on the south shore by the lake restaurant (taucher.net: entry at the Gaststätte Offlumer See), placed at the shore nearest the restaurant, so approximate. The lake is a nature reserve with swimming only at the beach; reports give about 18 m depth and little visibility below 7 m. No dive map or object positions were found.",
